  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced. To prepare the ingredients, rinse the quinoa. Halve the tomatoes, dice the cucumber, and finely chop the parsley. Slice the lemon into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/564c088cfd2cb9c3098b4568/step_564c09d1f1406.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the quinoa in a small saucepan and cover with the boiling water. Bring to the boil. Simmer for 12-15 minutes or until the quinoa is tender. Drain. Transfer to a large bowl and stir through the cherry tomato, cucumber, parsley and red onion. Drizzle with some olive oil and season to taste with salt and pepper. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/564c088cfd2cb9c3098b4568/step_56e9d7d8e6d52.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, place the falafels on the prepared oven tray. Cook in the oven for 5-10 minutes or until heated through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/564c088cfd2cb9c3098b4568/step_56e9d7d910834.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide the quinoa tabbouleh between bowls and top with the falafels and hummus. Squeeze with the lemon wedges and enjoy!"
    }
  ]
